+
+/// `GXVideoManager::flip` (0x4013bf) presents the back buffer (`videomgr+0x20`, an
+/// `IDirectDrawSurface`): `Flip` in fullscreen, `Blt` to the primary in windowed mode. Drawing the
+/// other player's cursor on the back buffer right before that puts it on top of the finished frame.
